Falsifies `address_space_layout::verification::service_window_refuses_every_virtual_address_its_doc_forbids`.

The defect: `service_window` checks against a band one page too wide, so the first page past `SERVICE_WINDOWS` is accepted.

Expected to fail: the harness's `refused_inputs_never_reach_here` loop is reached, an unwinding failure, at `SERVICE_WINDOWS.end`.

diff --git a/src/lib.rs b/src/lib.rs
--- a/src/lib.rs
+++ b/src/lib.rs
@@ -277,7 +277,7 @@
 /// **A service window's address, checked against the map at compile time.** As [`pair_page`], for
 /// [`SERVICE_WINDOWS`].
 pub const fn service_window(virtual_address: u64) -> u64 {
-    window(SERVICE_WINDOWS, virtual_address, PAGE_BYTES)
+    window(Band { start: SERVICE_WINDOWS.start, end: SERVICE_WINDOWS.end + PAGE_BYTES }, virtual_address, PAGE_BYTES)
 }
 
